---
Print the sensor id and secret a device signs with. Owner only.
Anyone with the secret can send values as this sensor: keep it private.

Usage: hn sensors credentials [OPTIONS] <SENSOR>

Arguments:
  <SENSOR>  Sensor id

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

Global options:
  -p, --profile <NAME>  Profile to use (server and login), see 'hn profile list'
      --json            Print JSON instead of tables (stable shape, for scripts)

Examples:
  hn sensors credentials <sensor-id>
  hn sensors credentials <sensor-id> --json | jq -r .secret
